        {
          "id": "c4",
          "field": "history.variant",
          "text": "Bulbapedia says Team Rocket introduced Dark Pokémon and describes their dark artwork windows, evolution boxes, and Pokédex boxes as a visual system distinct from normal Pokémon cards.",
